              "declaration": "theorem M8.Cutoff.anchor_trial_envelope : ∀ (N a b : ℕ), a ≤ N → b ≤ N → 2*N*a*b ≤ 2*N^3 := by\n  change ∀ (N a b : ℕ), a ≤ N → b ≤ N → 2 * N * a * b ≤ 2 * N ^ 3\n  intro N a b ha hb\n  calc\n    2 * N * a * b ≤ 2 * N * N * N :=\n      Nat.mul_le_mul (Nat.mul_le_mul_left (2 * N) ha) hb\n    _ = 2 * N ^ 3 := by ring",
